      "structure_hint": "derivation",
      "title": "乘积求导推导",
      "origin": "synthetic/offline",
      "messages": [
        {
          "role": "user",
          "content": "推导两个函数乘积的导数。",
          "turn_id": "derivation-product-0"
        },
        {
          "role": "assistant",
          "content": "设 $u,v$ 在 $x$ 可导。差商分解为 $u(x+h)\\frac{v(x+h)-v(x)}h+v(x)\\frac{u(x+h)-u(x)}h$。可导蕴含连续，取极限得 $(uv)\\prime=u v\\prime+v u\\prime$。",
          "turn_id": "derivation-product-0"
        }
      ],
      "review_checks": [
        "可导前提",
        "差商分解",
        "连续性用于取极限"
      ],
      "human_review": "not_run",
      "content_tendency": "derivation"
    },
    {
      "id": "derivation-integral",
      "structure_hint": "derivation",
      "title": "分部积分的条件和边界",
      "origin": "synthetic/offline",
      "messages": [
        {
          "role": "user",
          "content": "从乘积求导推出分部积分。",
          "turn_id": "derivation-integral-0"
        },
        {
          "role": "assistant",
          "content": "设 $u,v$ 在 $[a,b]$ 上连续可微。由 $(uv)\\prime=u\\prime v+uv\\prime$ 积分可得 $\\int_a^b u v\\prime\\,dx=[uv]_a^b-\\int_a^b u\\prime v\\,dx$。",
          "turn_id": "derivation-integral-0"
        },
        {
          "role": "user",
          "content": "端点项能省略吗？",
          "turn_id": "derivation-integral-1"
        },
        {
          "role": "assistant",
          "content": "一般不能；只有已知 $[uv]_a^b=0$ 等相应条件时才能省略。",
          "turn_id": "derivation-integral-1"
        }
      ],
      "review_checks": [
        "连续可微条件",
        "积分区间",
        "端点项不能无条件省略"
      ],
      "human_review": "not_run",
      "content_tendency": "derivation"
